WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.736
Tiéfo Amoro ni Noumoudara.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.760
Noumoudara tun ye Tiéfo dugumɔgɔw ka duguba dɔ ye.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.544
Saan 1800 wagati la, Tiéfo Amoro lo tun y'o jɛnkulu ɲɛminɛ.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.146
Saan 2026 la, kalan dɔ kɛra Bobo-Dioulasso dugu kɔnɔ min b'a yira ko a ye Tiéfow ka kuntigi 11nan ye. A wolola saan 1840 wagati la.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.304
Saan 1897 la, Samory Touré tagara Bobo-Dioulasso mara la.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.808
O lajɛnba yɛrɛ kɔnɔ, Tiéfo Amoro y'a fɔ ko a ye kɛlɛ caaman kɛ n'a ye.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.904
Samori ye dugu lamini.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.946
A jigira fɔ ka taga se lɔgɔkun kelen ma. O kɔ, a ko o ye muso halaki janko k'a ta fanga yira a ra.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:11.616
Lɔnnikɛla min kofɔra o kalan na, ale y'a fɔ ko n'u ye mɔgɔ dɔ janfa, o tun bena a to Tiéfo Amoro ka sɔrɔdasiw tora fanga la.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.554
An k'a ye ko a laban kɛra cogo min na, an ka o sɔrɔyɔrɔ kelen dɔrɔn le ra. A sɛbɛra nin cogo le ra yan, ani a bɛ to ka kɛ can ye.
